    "b914ff23-f5c1-4aa8-b0cf-04e04c184613": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14846180851793__b914ff23-f5c1-4aa8-b0cf-04e04c184613-16850362478a778587-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Supporting the Community",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "template--14846180851793__b914ff23-f5c1-4aa8-b0cf-04e04c184613-16850362478a778587-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>When you choose Orenda, something quiet happens alongside it.<\/em><\/p><p><em>A portion of our sales flows into the Heart of Orenda Fund, and from there into the lives of people who need it most. Not as a campaign. Not as a seasonal initiative. Since the day we opened our doors in 2002, this has simply been part of who we are.<\/em><\/p><p><em>The children reached through Smile Train receive cleft surgeries that give them back their smile, their voice, and their place in the world. Through Vitamin Angels, mothers and children in underserved communities receive the essential nutrients that too many go without. Feeding America works closer to home because hunger doesn't exist only far away, and our neighbors deserve the same care we'd want for our own. And Marbridge supports adults with intellectual disabilities in living full, independent, meaningful lives. This one is close to our hearts in ways that go beyond a charitable commitment.<\/em><\/p><p><em>You know these worlds. Maybe not all of them. But if you've ever sat with a child who needed more than the world was giving them, or watched someone you love struggle for the independence they deserved, or wondered how a family nearby was going to make it through the week, you already understand why these four.<\/em><\/p><p><em>These aren't causes we chose lightly. They reflect something our community has always believed: that taking care of yourself and taking care of others are never really separate.<\/em><\/p><p><em>You came here for you. And quietly, without any extra effort, you showed up for them too. That means everything to us.<\/em><\/p><p><em>That's people lifting people. That's the heart of who we are.<\/em><\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
